entity\ue202[\"turn729898product1\",\"ViewSonic - LS740HD 5,000 ANSI Lumens 1080p Laser Installati\u2026\"]\ue201**\n\n(Best value)\n\n5,000 ANSI lumens \u00b7 1080p \u00b7 Laser\n\n\\$999.99\n\nGood for small to medium-sized sanctuaries.\n\nBest Buy\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn729898product15\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"5:4\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn729898product15\",\"Epson PowerLite L690U 6500-Lumen WUXGA Laser 3LCD Projector \u2026\"]\ue201**\n\n(Brighter sanctuary option)\n\n6,500 ISO lumens \u00b7 WUXGA \u00b7 Laser 3LCD\n\n\\$3,515.00\n\nSuitable for larger screens and spaces with more ambient light.\n\nB&amp;H Photo\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn729898product14\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"5:4\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn729898product14\",\"BenQ LH860ST 5000-Lumen Full HD Short-Throw Laser DLP Projec\u2026\"]\ue201**\n\n(Short throw)\n\n5,000 ANSI lumens \u00b7 1080p \u00b7 Laser\n\n\\$2,399.00\n\nUseful when the projector needs to sit close to the screen.\n\nB&amp;H Photo\n\n## What brightness does your church need?\n\n| Church environment | Suggested brightness |\n|--------|--------|\n| Small room, dim lighting | 3,000\u20134,000 lumens |\n| Medium sanctuary | 4,000\u20136,000 lumens |\n| Large sanctuary, lights on | 6,000\u201310,000+ lumens |\n\nThese are starting estimates; screen size and lighting significantly affect the"}],"c":11}   

